    <h1>Brain Puzzle 3 Level 101 Answer: Help them survive.</h1>

    <div class="disclaimer">Unofficial fan-made guide. Not affiliated with the developer of Brain Puzzle 3.</div>
<div class="verify-note">Scene and goal confirmed by a second independent guide (showgamer); the two write some moves differently, so if a step does not react, compare with the embedded video.</div>
    <div class="answer-box">
      <span class="label">Quick answer</span>
      <p>Level 101 “Hard Choice”: Help them survive. 26 moves in order (2 drags, 1 taps, 21 swipes). Follow the step cards below or copy the video move-for-move.</p>
    </div>
