    <h2>Level 101 walkthrough: every move in order<span class="accent">.</span></h2>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 1–3</span>
      <strong>Do not choose “Save Mom” (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Do not choose “Save Mom”. Do not choose “Save Wife”. Swipe down the girl's skirt.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 4–6</span>
      <strong>Swipe down (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Swipe down on the girl’s earring. Drag the man’s tie onto the girl’s face. Swipe down the girl's bag.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 7–9</span>
      <strong>Swipe down the girl's shoes (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Swipe down the girl's shoes. Swipe down the girl's black stockings. Swipe down the girl's chicken claw stockings.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 10–12</span>
      <strong>Swipe down the girl's bandage stockings (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Swipe down the girl's bandage stockings. Swipe down the dollar bills on the girl's legs. Swipe down mom's thick coat.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 13–15</span>
      <strong>Swipe down the gold bars (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Swipe down the gold bars on mom's body. Tap to open mom's mouth. Swipe down mom's gold teeth.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 16–18</span>
      <strong>Swipe down mom's belly (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Swipe down mom's belly. Swipe down mom's collar. Swipe down on Mom’s gem necklace.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 19–21</span>
      <strong>Swipe down mom's wig (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Swipe down mom's wig. Swipe up mom's pants. Swipe down the handsome guy photos.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 22–24</span>
      <strong>Swipe up the man's left sleeve (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Swipe up the man's left sleeve. Swipe up the man's right sleeve. Swipe down the gold watch on the man's left wrist.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 25–26</span>
      <strong>Swipe down the gold watch (then 1 more)</strong>
      <p>Swipe down the gold watch on the man's right wrist. Drag the spinach to the man.</p>
